# Console performance

Before changing console pages, routes, API endpoints, or data fetching, follow `.cursor/skills/console-performance/SKILL.md`.

- Lazy-load route pages. Do not statically import unused page components.
- Fetch with TanStack Query (`useQuery` / `useMutation`), never `useEffect` + `api.*`.
- One in-flight request per resource. Do not refetch setup on every navigation.
- Endpoints must return only the fields the page needs. Admission must not load full setup.
- GET requests must not send `Content-Type: application/json`.
